// ReEQ2's analog-matched filter core: fitted sections for every band type.
// ReEQ2's @init allocates the three shared banks (AF_Bank, AF_Notch, AF_Anchor) and fills them once
// with ef_tables_init.
// This file exists twice. Source/ReEQ2/analog-fast.jsfx-inc is the one to edit: its numbers
// are ordinary decimals. ReEQ2/Dependencies/analog-fast.jsfx-inc is built from it by Source/build.py
// with every integer in hex, and is the one REAPER loads. Source/README.md says why.
